Third-party dependencies
------------------------

This package's implementations ARE its dependencies: the quantitative
baselines are the upstream engines, not reimplementations of them. The
authoritative, hash-pinned list is this package's own `uv.lock`, and the CI
license lane emits a CycloneDX SBOM per package from it. The direct
dependencies and their licenses:

    numpy           BSD-3-Clause
    pandas          BSD-3-Clause
    polars          MIT
    ruptures        BSD-2-Clause
    scikit-learn    BSD-3-Clause
    scipy           BSD-3-Clause
    splink          MIT
    statsforecast   Apache-2.0
    statsmodels     BSD-3-Clause

Each package under packages/ carries its own LICENSE and NOTICE and is
distributed independently.
